#: ../hacks/config/alienbeacon.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"Our investigation of the signal from the planet's surface brought us to "
"what\n"
"seems to be an alien beacon. Based on the rock formation around the beacon, "
"it\n"
"was probably left here millions of years ago.\n"
"\n"
"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ld2SzK\n"
"\n"
"Written by Otavio Good; 2014.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Notre enquête sur le signal provenant de la surface de la planète nous a "
"amené à ce que\n"
"semble être une balise extraterrestre. Basé sur la formation rocheuse autour "
"de la balise, il\n"
"a probablement été laissé ici il y a des millions d'années.\n"
"\n"
"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ld2SzK\n"
"\n"
"Écrit par Otavio Good; 2014.\n"
"  "

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:1
msgid "Amiga Juggler"
msgstr "Jongleur Amiga"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Une reconstitution en temps réel de la démo Amiga \"Juggler\" d'Eric Graham "
"de 1987 : un GLSL\n"
"port de son traceur de rayons récursif. Le robot, les boules, le damier\n"
"les réflexions du sol et du miroir sont toutes générées et tracées de "
"manière procédurale.\n"
"\n"
"Écrit par Brian Bernstein ; 2026.\n"
"  "

