# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/ant.xml.h:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cet économiseur d'écran a été supprimé de la distribution XScreenSaver à "
"partir de\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"Un automate cellulaire qui est en réalité une machine de Turing "
"bidimensionnelle :\n"
"lorsque les têtes (\"fourmis\") marchent le long de l'écran, elles changent "
"de pixel\n"
"valeurs sur leur chemin.  Puis, à mesure qu'ils passent au-dessus des pixels "
"modifiés, leur\n"
"le comportement est influencé.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Écrit par David Bagley ; 1997.\n"
"  "

