# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/sonar.xml.h:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"A sonar display pings (get it?) the hosts on your local network, and\n"
"plots their distance (response time) from you.\n"
"\n"
"The three rings represent ping times of approximately 2.5, 70 and 2,000\n"
"milliseconds respectively.\n"
"\n"
"Alternately, it can run a simulation that doesn't involve hosts.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ping_%28networking_utility%29#History\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski and Stephen Martin; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Un affichage sonar envoie une requête ping (vous comprenez ?) aux hôtes de "
"votre réseau local, et\n"
"trace leur distance (temps de réponse) par rapport à vous.\n"
"\n"
"Les trois anneaux représentent des temps de ping d'environ 2,5, 70 et 2 000\n"
"millisecondes respectivement.\n"
"\n"
"Alternativement, il peut exécuter une simulation qui n’implique pas "
"d’hôtes.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ping_%28networking_utility%29#History\n"
"\n"
"Écrit par Jamie Zawinski et Stephen Martin ; 1998.\n"
"  "

