# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/webcollage.xml.h:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"This is what the Internet looks like.\n"
"\n"
"This creates collages out of random images from the World Wide Web.\n"
"It finds the images by feeding random words into various search\n"
"engines, and pulling images (or sections of images) out of the pages\n"
"returned.\n"
"\n"
"WARNING: THE INTERNET SOMETIMES CONTAINS PORNOGRAPHY.\n"
"\n"
"The Internet being what it is, absolutely anything might show up in the\n"
"collage including -- quite possibly -- pornography, or even nudity.\n"
"Please act accordingly.\n"
"\n"
"See also https://www.jwz.org/webcollage/\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Voilà à quoi ressemble Internet.\n"
"\n"
"Cela crée des collages à partir d'images aléatoires provenant du World Wide "
"Web.\n"
"Il trouve les images en introduisant des mots aléatoires dans diverses "
"recherches\n"
"moteurs et extraire des images (ou des sections d’images) des pages\n"
"est revenu.\n"
"\n"
"AVERTISSEMENT : INTERNET CONTIENT PARFOIS DE LA PORNOGRAPHIE.\n"
"\n"
"Internet étant ce qu'il est, absolument tout peut apparaître dans le\n"
"collage comprenant - très probablement - de la pornographie, voire de la "
"nudité.\n"
"Veuillez agir en conséquence.\n"
"\n"
"Voir aussi https://www.jwz.org/webcollage/\n"
"\n"
"Écrit par Jamie Zawinski; 1998.\n"
"  "

